<title>HUNGARY: EGIS JAN-SEPT 96 NET PROFIT 4.082 BLN.</title>
<headline>EGIS JAN-SEPT 96 NET PROFIT 4.082 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept</p>
<p>30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 96     Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		3,550.2   vs    3,067.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  4,082.2   vs    3,825.4</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		4,082.2   vs    3,825.4</p>
<p>    Net sales			17,353.6   vs   14,444.4</p>
<p>     Net domestic sales	   9,475.6   vs    7,930.9</p>
<p>     Net export sales	     7,878.0   vs    6,513.5</p>
<p>    Other revenue		     466.9   vs	456.9</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	 5,340.7     vs   4,431.2</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     8,052.0     vs   6,578.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    412.7 pft vs     375.2 pft</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     470.1     vs     603.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures	 57.4     vs     227.9</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	119.3 pft vs     383.1 pft</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 230.8     vs     441.0</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure   111.5     vs	57.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Egis Gyogyszergyar Rt is a pharmaceuticals company,</p>
<p>majority owned by France's Servier S.A.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
